Announcing Slash'EM version 0.0.7E4 (development) ... 

Version 0.0.7E4 is the latest alpha release in the current development
branch of Slash'EM. Depending on the number and type of bugs reported
against this version we will decide whether another alpha version is called
for or whether we can move to beta development.

Version 0.0.7E4 is based on the NetHack 3.4.2 codebase. It has a much faster
proxy window interface (both caching to speed start-up and an async protocol
to reduce latency). Four game-over bugs have been fixed plus loads of more
minor problems resolved.

The windows core binary now comes with the native gui window interface,
which is now the default. The tty interface is still available and may
be selected viw the windowtype option in the defaults.nh file.

Slash'EM homepage:
http://www.slashem.org/

Source is available from the main file download area:
http://sourceforge.net/project/showfiles.php?group_id=9746

